  "AI-generated food recognition, recipes, substitutions, expiration estimates, calorie estimates, and nutrition information may be incomplete or inaccurate. Check ingredient labels, food safety, allergies, dietary requirements, and cooking temperatures yourself. Friyo does not provide medical advice.": "AI 生成的食物识别、食谱、替代食材、保质期估计、热量估计及营养信息可能不完整或不准确。请自行核对食材标签、食品安全、过敏原、饮食要求和烹饪温度。Friyo 不提供医疗建议。",
  "Do not post unlawful, abusive, discriminatory, sexually explicit, dangerous, deceptive, infringing, or privacy-invasive content. Do not impersonate others, harass users, distribute spam, or attempt to interfere with the service. Friyo may remove content or restrict accounts that violate these rules.": "请勿发布违法、辱骂、歧视、色情、危险、欺骗、侵权或侵犯隐私的内容。请勿冒充他人、骚扰用户、传播垃圾信息或干扰服务。Friyo 可以删除违反规则的内容或限制相关账号。",
  "Friyo may use infrastructure and processing providers such as Railway, PostgreSQL, Redis, Amazon Web Services, Firebase, Expo, Google, and OpenAI. They process information only as needed to provide their services and subject to their applicable data-protection commitments.": "Friyo 可能使用 Railway、PostgreSQL、Redis、Amazon Web Services、Firebase、Expo、Google 和 OpenAI 等基础设施及处理服务。这些服务商仅在提供服务所需的范围内处理信息，并遵守适用的数据保护承诺。",
  "Friyo processes account details such as your name and email; dietary preferences, allergies, cooking preferences, and health goals you provide; fridge inventory, meal plans, saved recipes, and cooking history; photos submitted for fridge scanning or community posts; AI chat requests; community posts, comments, likes, and reports; and technical information needed to secure and operate the service.": "Friyo 处理的信息包括姓名和邮箱等账号资料；你提供的饮食偏好、过敏信息、烹饪偏好和健康目标；冰箱库存、餐食计划、收藏食谱及烹饪记录；用于冰箱扫描或社区帖子的照片；AI 对话请求；社区帖子、评论、点赞和举报；以及保障服务安全与运行所需的技术信息。",
  "Friyo provides tools for food inventory, recipe discovery, meal planning, AI assistance, and community participation. Features may change as the service improves.": "Friyo 提供食材库存、食谱发现、餐食规划、AI 辅助和社区参与工具。功能可能随着服务改进而调整。",
  "We retain account information while your account is active and as reasonably necessary to operate and secure the service. You can permanently delete your account from Settings. Account deletion removes your profile and associated inventory, scans, meal records, and user-generated content, except information we must retain for legal, security, or fraud-prevention obligations.": "我们会在账号有效期间，以及运营和保护服务所合理需要的期限内保留账号信息。你可以在设置中永久删除账号。删除账号会移除个人资料及关联的库存、扫描、餐食记录和用户生成内容，但法律、安全或防欺诈义务要求保留的信息除外。",
  "We use this information to authenticate your account, maintain your inventory, personalize recipes and meal plans, provide AI-assisted features, operate community functionality, prevent abuse, send requested notifications, troubleshoot problems, and improve reliability.": "我们使用这些信息验证账号、维护库存、个性化推荐食谱和餐食计划、提供 AI 辅助功能、运行社区功能、防止滥用、发送你请求的通知、排查问题及提高服务可靠性。",
  "We work to keep Friyo available and reliable, but do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation. To the extent permitted by law, the service is provided as available without warranties not expressly stated here.": "我们努力保持 Friyo 可用和可靠，但不保证服务不中断或完全没有错误。在法律允许的范围内，服务按现状提供，不作本条款未明确说明的保证。",
  "When you choose AI chat or fridge scanning, the content needed to complete your request may be sent to Google Gemini or OpenAI for processing. This can include your prompt, a submitted fridge image, relevant inventory, and dietary preferences. Friyo requests your permission before first use. Avoid including unnecessary sensitive personal information.": "当你选择 AI 对话或冰箱扫描时，完成请求所需的内容可能会发送至 Google Gemini 或 OpenAI 处理，其中可能包括提示词、冰箱照片、相关库存及饮食偏好。Friyo 会在首次使用前请求授权。请避免提供非必要的敏感个人信息。",
  "You are responsible for providing accurate account information, protecting access to your account, and notifying Friyo about unauthorized use. You may delete your account at any time from Settings.": "你有责任提供准确的账号信息、保护账号访问权限，并在发现未经授权使用时通知 Friyo。你可以随时在设置中删除账号。",
  "You can decline device permissions, withdraw AI processing consent in Settings, edit your profile, delete individual content where available, log out, or permanently delete your account. Some features will not work without the information or permission they require.": "你可以拒绝设备权限、在设置中撤回 AI 处理授权、编辑个人资料、在支持的地方删除单条内容、退出登录或永久删除账号。部分功能需要相应信息或权限才能使用。",
  "You retain ownership of content you submit. You grant Friyo the limited rights needed to host, process, display, moderate, and distribute that content within the service. You must have permission to upload the content you submit.": "你保留所提交内容的所有权。你授予 Friyo 在服务内托管、处理、显示、审核和分发这些内容所必需的有限权利。你必须有权上传所提交的内容。",
  "Friyo is not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.": "Friyo 不面向 13 岁以下儿童，我们不会明知故犯地收集 13 岁以下儿童的个人信息。",
  "To provide AI chat and fridge scanning, Friyo sends the text, image, fridge items, and dietary preferences needed for your request to Google Gemini or OpenAI. Do not submit sensitive personal information. You can review the Privacy Policy in Settings.": "为提供 AI 对话和冰箱扫描，Friyo 会将请求所需的文字、照片、冰箱食材和饮食偏好发送给 Google Gemini 或 OpenAI。请勿提交敏感个人信息。你可以在设置中查看隐私政策。",
